# A pin deliberately far behind, for update-pixi-test.yml. The test runs the action
# against this file and asserts what it rewrote and what it reported.
#
# DO NOT REFRESH THE PIN BELOW. A fixture pinned to the latest release would make the
# whole test pass by having nothing to update - the assertion that `changed` is true
# would then be asserting nothing. 0.1.0 is chosen to stay stale permanently.
#
# The trailing `python` is not decoration: it is use_pixi's optional template argument,
# and it is here so the test can assert the rewrite replaces one field rather than the
# rest of the line.
use pixi 0.1.0 python
